--==============================================================================
-- THE MIRE-CAGE POD -- SIXTEEN PARTS, SHARED BY ALL FIVE SPECIES
--
-- Every size and offset is a FRACTION OF DIAMETER: three lower mire sepals, a
-- seven-reed crooked cage, the equatorial flood seam, the suspended cyan dew
-- seal on its stem, and the side water bead.
--
-- The species is not knowable from any of it, and that is the point of one pod
-- for five: the shell says what the pod WEIGHS, and nothing says what is inside
-- it until somebody holds E.
--==============================================================================
