--==============================================================================
-- WHAT SLEEP CHANGES THAT IS NOT A JOINT
--
-- Three of the approved sleep channels are properties, not articulation, and a
-- joint-only rig would silently drop all three:
--
--   the throat SHRINKS      ThroatSac 3.13 -> 2.52, and its ribs with it
--   the throat DIMS         its light 0.659 -> 0.204
--   the eyes CLOSE          LeftEye/RightEye transparency 0 -> 1, lids recolour
--
-- Stored as the ASLEEP value against the rest (awake) value, so ParentAnim can
-- lerp them on the same wake scalar that drives the joints and the whole body
-- therefore arrives together.
--==============================================================================
